WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.567
Every presentation starts with a blank slide.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.600
And hours of nudging boxes

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600
until it finally looks right.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:09.600
Meet Stagecraft.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.500
A free presentation app for Windows that makes

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.200
every slide look designed, without the effort.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:18.900
Pick one of ten designer themes,

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.700
choose a smart layout, and just type.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.600
Text fits itself, smart guides line everything up,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.633
and one click on Tidy fixes a messy selection.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.433
Add charts,

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:35.067
tables and over a thousand icons in seconds.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.467
Press Control K,

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:39.433
and every command is one search away.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.233
Then bring it to life.

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:45.000
Morph glides your shapes between slides,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.233
and the animation pane lets you fly, fade,

00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:52.167
spin and draw motion paths, click by click.

00:00:52.733 --> 00:00:55.367
Drop in a video or background music,

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.333
trim it right in Stagecraft,

00:00:57.333 --> 00:01:01.467
and link to websites, files or any other slide.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:05.500
When it's showtime, presenter view keeps your notes,

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.267
a timer and the next slide

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.400
in front of you,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.367
with a laser pointer and a pen at hand.

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:14.500
Export to PDF and images,

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.367
or to PowerPoint with your animations, links and video,

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:21.100
and bring your PowerPoint decks in.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.133
It runs on Windows 7 to 11,

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:29.133
64-bit, 32-bit and ARM, saves your work automatically,

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:31.467
and keeps itself up to date.

00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:34.633
Stagecraft is free.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:38.600
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/stagecraft
